s="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-0bd0acfefc8c5b.jpg" width="Auto"/></div><div class="blog-content-container right-padding"><div class="main-content-wrapper"><p class="feature-paragraph">January 21, 2023</p><h2 class="blog-title">Wine lovers, rejoice! The French Riviera is home to some of the world's most renowned vineyards</h2><p class="paragraph-15">Wine lovers, rejoice! The French Riviera is home to some of the world's most renowned vineyards, and Hotel Toile Blanche is the perfect base for exploring the area's wine scene. Here are five wine experiences you won't want to miss during your stay</p></div><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="blog/wine-lovers.html">Read Article</a></div></div></div><div class="blog-list-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="blog-image-container large-height right-padding" id="offer1"><img alt="10 Best Swimming Holes at (and around) Toile Blanche" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-0bd0acfefc8c5b.jpg" width="Auto"/></div><div class="blog-content-container right-padding"><div class="main-content-wrapper"><p class="feature-paragraph">January 21, 2023</p><h2 class="blog-title">10 Best Swimming Holes at (and around) Toile Blanche</h2><p class="paragraph-15">10 Best Swimming Holes at (and around) Toile Blanche</p></div><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="blog/10-best-swimmig-holes.html">Read Article</a></div></div></div><div class="blog-list-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="blog-image-container large-height right-padding" id="offer1"><img alt="A self-guided tour itinerary of the area surrounding Hotel Toile Blanche in Vence, French Riviera." class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-4096fb7a8a053f.jpg" width="Auto"/></div><div class="blog-content-container right-padding"><div class="main-content-wrapper"><p class="feature-paragraph">January 21, 2023</p><h2 class="blog-title">A self-guided tour itinerary of the area surrounding Hotel Toile Blanche in Vence, French Riviera.</h2><p class="paragraph-15">Start your tour at the Fondation Maeght, a modern art museum featuring works by famous artists such as Joan Miro and Marc Chagall. </p></div><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="blog/self-guided-tour-itinarary.html">Read Article</a></div></div></div><div class="blog-list-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="blog-image-container large-height right-padding" id="offer1"><img alt="Things to do around Toile Blanche" class="card-image" loading="eager" src="/assets/images/page-img-28965838c96078.jpg" width="Auto"/></div><div class="blog-content-container right-padding"><div class="main-content-wrapper"><p class="feature-paragraph">January 21, 2023</p><h2 class="blog-title">Things to do around Toile Blanche</h2><p class="paragraph-15">Hotel Toile Blanche is located in the charming town of Vence, in the French Riviera. The area surrounding the hotel offers a variety of activities and attractions for visitors to enjoy.</p></div><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="blog/tings-to-do-around-toile-blanche.html">Read Article</a></div></div></div><div class="blog-list-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="blog-image-container large-height right-padding" id="offer1"><img alt="Best places to eat the tastiest local food around Toile Blanche" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-0bd0acfefc8c5b.jpg" width="Auto"/></div><div class="blog-content-container right-padding"><div class="main-content-wrapper"><p class="feature-paragraph">October 28, 2021</p><h2 class="blog-title">Best places to eat the tastiest local food around Toile Blanche</h2><p class="paragraph-15">When visiting the beautiful city of Toile Blanche, one of the best ways to immerse yourself in the local culture is by trying the delicious and diverse cuisine. </p></div><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="blog/best-places-to-eat-the-tastiest-local-food-around-toile-blanche.html">Read Article</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="section bg-color-2 hide"><div class="container"><div class="cta-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid cta-3-grid"><div class="cta-area-1" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af06-f049af02"><p>Subscribe to our newsletter to receive news about the Côte d'Azur, our latest offers, special dishes from the chef’s table and much more. Not too often — Just enough. Join the 2K travellers before you!</p></div><div class="cta-area-2" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af09-f049af02"><h3>Don't be a stranger</h3></div><div class="cta-area-3" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af0c-f049af02"><div class="newsletter-form-block w-form"><form class="newsletter-form" data-name="Newsletter Form" data-wf-element-id="a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af0e" data-wf-page-id="63df93af2ae9b00601d58226" id="wf-form-Newsletter-Form" method="get" name="wf-form-Newsletter-Form"><div class="newsletter-input"><label for="Full-Name">Name</label><input class="form-input w-input" data-name="Full Name" id="Full-Name" maxlength="256" name="Full-Name" placeholder="John Doe" required="" type="text"/></div><div class="newsletter-input"><label for="Email">Email Address</label><input class="form-input w-input" data-name="Email" id="Email" maxlength="256" name="Email" placeholder="john.doe@myemail.com" required="" type="email"/></div><input class="submit-button w-button" data-wait="Please wait..." type="submit" value="Try it out now!"/></form><div class="w-form-done"><div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class="w-form-fail"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submittin